==Strategy==
Not very hard but it can still prove to be a fair challenge. This stage is recommended to start grinding Elder Catfruit on, due to the [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] type's many exploitable weaknesses. The Pigeon de Sables are manageable due to their low health, as well as The Face, due to his horrible movement speed.

However, you must be wary of Li'l Bun Buns and Brollows, as when a combination of the two pile up, they can smash through your ranks with ease. [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] or [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] should do very well in this stage. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] is very good for starting cash and you will want it for Pigeons and [[An Elder Secret (Merciless)|An Elder Secret]] anyway (to defend against the [[Berserkory]]).

Any unit that [[Slow|slows]] [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] such as [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] (Survive [[Talents]] help) will make this stage much more manageable. Keep in mind said units like Sanzo Cat will die to The Face if the stacks of Brollows, Pigeons and Li'l Bun Buns are defeated too quickly.

